    "content": "**Root cause:** Python's `$` in regex matches before a trailing newline by default, so headers ending with `\\n` (like `\"bar\\n\"`, `\"foo\\n\"`, `\"\\n\"`) silently passed validation.\n\n**Fix:** Replaced `$` with `\\Z` in all four header validation regexes. `\\Z` matches only at the absolute end of the string, ensuring trailing newlines are properly rejected."
